sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant SPA as React SPA (Journal Entry Page)
  participant Routes as REST Route Layer
  participant Session as Session and Role Resolver
  participant Policy as SoD Policy
  participant ApprovalSvc as Approval Service
  participant HistRepo as History Repository (append-only)

  User->>SPA: Open manual journal entry page
  SPA->>Routes: GET /api/entries/{entryId}/history
  Routes->>Session: Resolve caller identity and roles
  Session-->>Routes: Caller context
  Routes->>Policy: Authorise read of entry history
  Policy-->>Routes: Allowed
  Routes->>ApprovalSvc: getHistory(entryId)
  ApprovalSvc->>HistRepo: SELECT rows WHERE entryId ORDER BY actedAt DESC
  HistRepo-->>ApprovalSvc: submit, reject, resubmit, approve rows
  ApprovalSvc-->>Routes: history ordered newest first
  Routes-->>SPA: 200 JSON [ {action, actingUser, actedAt, reason}, ... ]
  SPA-->>User: Render approval history list, newest first, no edit/delete controls

  Note over User,HistRepo: Any attempt to mutate a history row is refused
  User->>SPA: Issue edit or delete request against a history row
  SPA->>Routes: PATCH or DELETE /api/entries/{entryId}/history/{historyId}
  Routes->>Policy: Authorise mutation of history
  Policy-->>Routes: Denied - history table is insert-only
  Routes-->>SPA: 405 Method Not Allowed
  SPA-->>User: Show refusal, history list unchanged
